#32004
Inside the Tree~
   You are inside a knobby, old tree.  But you wouldn't know that from
inside here that the tree was knobby and old.  A small ladder on the northern
side of the tree leads down into darkness.  The tree is well carved out
and the walls are smooth to the touch.  You think you hear faint sounds of
movement coming from below.
