#32005
Under the Tree~
   Under the tree is truly an unexpected sight.  A warm fireplace burns
on the far wall of the moderately large room.  A wolfskin rug lies on the
hardwood floor of the humble abode.  Several bookshelves littered with old
scripts and manuals and charts line the walls.  There is a small ladder 
leading back up to the door of the tree.  A small chair sits before the
fireplace with its back to you.  The sweet scent of pipe smoke wafts through
the air coming from the other side of the chair.
~
