The Guardtower~
   You crawl through the small hole up into the guard tower.  A roof over-
head with small holes in it keeps the strong, wet wind from blowing
you off the tower.  Looking out of the tower you can see the entire
wasteland of the Serdim-ir-Lesk stretch out to the southern horizon.
Gnarled black trees dot the scene through the thick fog which covers the
entire swamp floor like a thick, gray blanket.  A small hole in the floor
of the tower with thick hemp rope dangling down through it leads back down
to the ground.
