#32029
The Guardtower~
   You pull yourself up the rope into the tower and heave yourself
to your feet awkwardly.  As you do so the tower shakes and rattles but
holds fast.  You take in a deep breath as the shivering of the wooden tower
finally stops and take in the sights provided by the tower's elevation.
To the south you look out over the Serdim-ir-Lesk which sits silently
in a wet gloom.  Thick fog covers the swamp as far as the southern
horizon. The Western Mountains under Gmra's rule stand to the north and
far off to the east, across the Great Plains lies The Dominion's Capital
City, Phalar.  The sky is clear above the city which is home to most of
The Dominion's 'civilized' inhabitants.
~
