#32172
The Valley~
   You stand in the misty valley among trees of every shape, size and
strange color; their trunks are painted in reds, browns, golds and blues
as if by some mad artist.  Thick gray mist swirls between the branches,
hiding the sky, and steep bluffs rise up through the fog all around the
valley.  The air carries a hint of spice, as though someone were cooking
nearby.  Paths lead north, east, south and west.
~
