The Dominion Room~
You are standing in a room with a large golden framed picture 
of different landscapes on every wall.  The northern wall has a 
picture of a great mountain range.  The western is a dark forest
with lush green trees everywhere.  On the eastern wall is a framed
picture of hills stretching off towards a golden sunset.  On the
southern wall is a magnificent plain with a large city on the
horizon.
