#32241
The Tomb of the Valiant~
   This small chamber lies beneath the mushroom garden, dry and still,
untouched by the swamp above.  A stone bier holds the remains of a tall
elf in rusted mail, his hands folded over the hilt of a broken short
sword, the twin of the one the statue raises above.  The walls are
painted with faded scenes of a lone warrior holding back a tide of dark
shapes at the gate of a garden.  A narrow stair climbs back up into the
garden.
~
